  "prompt": [
    "Client: Harbourline Commerce, a multi-tenant retail order platform with about 400 tenants. Database hlc-orders-prod: Azure SQL Database, Business Critical, Gen5, 16 vCores, compatibility level 160, READ_COMMITTED_SNAPSHOT ON. All times are UTC. Business hours are 07:30 to 18:00. The nightly batch must finish by 06:00. Evidence was collected from Mon 21 Sep to Sun 27 Sep 2026.",
    "Application notes from the development lead: six application instances; CommandTimeout 30 s; Max Pool Size 400 per",
    "instance since hotfix 5.2.3. The hotfix also added an outer retry policy to every repository call, reads and writes,",
    "dbo.usp_CreateOrder included: it retries timeouts and deadlocks up to 3 times with a fixed 2 s delay, no jitter and",
    "no circuit breaker. On Fri 25 between 09:00 and 14:30 the API received 74,500 dashboard requests. Support has logged",
    "23 'duplicate order' tickets since 16 Sep and none before. Name what makes a bad day worse and creates the duplicate",
    "orders."
  ],
